# Better Auth

- Writes: a Server Action calls `auth.api.*` with `headers: await headers()`; Better Auth checks permissions. Return `getAuthApiErrorMessage(error)`.
- Unauthenticated flows that send mail or check a password call `consumeRateLimit` first.
- Config change → `pnpm --filter @repo/db auth:generate` then `db:generate`; never edit `auth.schema.ts` by hand.

Guide: [docs/agents/better-auth.md](docs/agents/better-auth.md)
